OL,3,GNEWSAFootball team ahead of schedule
OL,4,Aafter FA Cup run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's football team has hailed its
OL,7,Ffirst year back as a success despite a
OL,8,Frecent 9-0 FA Cup loss.
OL,10,FBlyth Spartans Women played their first
OL,11,Fcompetitive match in September 2025
OL,12,Fafter 16 years away.
OL,14,FThe club reached the third round of FA
OL,15,FCup qualifiers, losing to Chorley Women
OL,16,FFC who are three tiers above them on 4
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
