OL,5,
OL,6,FBut head of women's football Linda Bush
OL,7,Fsaid the match was "a real celebration"
OL,8,Fwith more than 350 fans in attendance
OL,9,Fat Croft Park, in Northumberland, a
OL,10,Fcrowd some non-league men's sides would
OL,11,Fbe envious of.
